# Parallel_BO_Project

## Overview

This project implements a parallelized Bayesian Optimization (BO) framework for multi-objective regression tasks, focusing on cost and sustainability metrics in manufacturing processes. The workflow includes data preprocessing, exploratory data analysis (EDA), feature selection using distance correlation, and parallelized optimization using custom algorithms.

